# ---- kept on the computer, never uploaded --------------------------------------

# Local screenshot tool and its output
screenshot.mjs
temporary screenshots/

# Captures of other labs' websites, kept for design reference
inspiration/

# Markdown notes - only the README files belong in the repository
*.md
!README.md

# Source text for the site's wording
dorn_text_*

# Source files behind the artwork: the working files for each research scheme
# (Illustrator, ChemDraw, the unedited exports) and the logo exports no page uses.
